---
export const prerender = false;
// For owners: why a home owner would post a sit on MYAH, in one short page.
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---
<PublicLayout title="For home owners" description="Post your sit, meet ID-checked sitters with real reviews, and share your home details only with the sitter you choose. Free to join.">
  <section class="p-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">For home owners</p>
        <h1>Go away knowing <em>they're happy at home</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Post your dates, meet ID-checked sitters with real reviews, and pick the one who suits your pets.</p>
        <div class="acts"><a class="btn" href="/signup">Join as an owner</a><a class="btn-line" href="/how-it-works">How it works →</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pic"><img src="/images/slideshow-dogs-couch.jpeg" alt="Two dogs relaxing on the couch" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><h2>Why owners <em>choose MYAH</em></h2></div>
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card"><span class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Everyone is ID checked</h3><p>Photo ID and a selfie, checked by us before anyone can apply.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3.5l2.6 5.5 6 .8-4.4 4.2 1.1 6-5.3-2.9-5.3 2.9 1.1-6L3.4 9.8l6-.8z"/></svg></span><h3>Real reviews</h3><p>Read what other owners said after their sits before you choose.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="15" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5"/></svg></span><h3>Your address stays private</h3><p>Address, wifi and door codes go only to your confirmed sitter, the day before the sit.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z"/></svg></span><h3>Your pets' routines, written once</h3><p>Feeding, walks, vet details and quirks in one sit pack your sitter can check any time.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><h2>Three steps to <em>a sitter</em></h2></div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><span><b>Post your sit</b><span>Your dates, your home and your pets. Your profile details fill in for you.</span></span></li>
        <li><span><b>Meet your sitters</b><span>Sitters apply, or you invite ones who are free on your dates. Message them on MYAH.</span></span></li>
        <li><span><b>Confirm and hand over</b><span>Pick your sitter and the sit pack goes to them. Private details unlock the day before.</span></span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><h2>Keep <em>exploring</em></h2></div>
      <div class="next">
        <a href="/callumandniamh"><span><small>What sitters' pages look like</small><b>Meet Callum &amp; Niamh</b></span><i>→</i></a>
        <a href="/for-sitters"><span><small>The other side</small><b>For sitters</b></span><i>→</i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Find your <em>sitter</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Free to join. Post your first sit in a few minutes.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/signup">Join as an owner</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</PublicLayout>
